 "sentences": [
  "NASA is preparing to farm on the Moon.",
  "They signed a joint agreement with Canadian and German space agencies.",
  "The team is building an Earth-based demonstrator to test crop growth.",
  "These space crops will provide essential nutrition and variety for future astronauts.",
  "Plants will also recycle water, produce oxygen, and absorb carbon dioxide.",
  "This technology supports long-term missions near the Moon’s South Pole and beyond."
